hadiths[249]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Amr Shaibani se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Is ghar ke malik ne hamein hadees sunayi aur unhon ne apne hath se Abdullah [bin Masud] ke ghar ki taraf ishara kiya; unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Allah Azza wa Jalla ko kaun sa amal sab se zyada mehbub hai? Aap ne farmaya: ""Waqt par namaz."" Main ne poocha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir walidain se neki."" Main ne poocha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir Allah ke raaste mein jihad."" Un ne kaha: Aap ne mujhe yeh sab bataya; agar main mazeed poochta toh Aap mazeed batate."
"2","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rabb ki raza walid ki raza mein hai, aur Rabb ka ghadab walid ke ghadab mein."
"3","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Bahz bin Hakim se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se; unhon ne kaha: Main ne poocha: Ya Rasoolullah! Main kis se neki karun? Aap ne farmaya: ""Apni maa se."" Main ne poocha: Kis se neki karun? Aap ne farmaya: ""Apni maa se."" Main ne poocha: Kis se neki karun? Aap ne farmaya: ""Apni maa se."" Main ne poocha: Kis se neki karun? Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne baap se, phir jo sab se qareeb ho, phir jo us se qareeb ho."
"4","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs un ke paas aaya aur bola: Main ne ek aurat ko paigham diya toh us ne mujh se nikah se inkar kar diya; aur mere siwa kisi aur ne use paigham diya toh us ne us se nikah par razamandi zahir ki. Mujhe us par ghairat aayi toh main ne use qatl kar diya. Kya mere liye tauba hai? Un ne poocha: Kya tumhari maa zinda hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Un ne kaha: Allah Azza wa Jalla se tauba karo aur jitna ho sake uska qurb hasil karo. [Ata bin Yasar ne kaha:] Phir main gaya aur Ibn Abbas se poocha: Tum ne us se uski maa ki zindagi ke bare mein kyun poocha? Un ne kaha: ""Main Allah Azza wa Jalla ka qurb hasil karne wala maa se neki se zyada qareeb koi amal nahin jaanta."
"5","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Poocha gaya: Ya Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Main kis se neki karun? Aap ne farmaya: ""Apni maa se."" Un ne kaha: Phir kis se? Aap ne farmaya: ""Apni maa se."" Un ne kaha: Phir kis se? Aap ne farmaya: ""Apni maa se."" Un ne kaha: Phir kis se? [Phir chauthi baar] Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne baap se."
"6","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Taisalah bin Mayyas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Najdat [Najdah bin Amir ke Khariji pairukar] ke sath tha, phir main ne aise gunah kiye jinhein main kabira gunahon mein se samajhta tha. Main ne iska zikr Ibn Umar se kiya. Un ne poocha: Kya hain? Main ne kaha: Yun aur yun. Un ne kaha: ""Yeh kabira gunahon mein se nahin. Kabira gunah nau hain: Allah ke sath shirk, jaan ka qatl, maidan-e-jang se bhagna, pak-daman aurat par zina ki tohmat, sood khana, yateem ka maal khana, masjid mein ilhad, woh jo [deen ka] mazaq udaye, aur walidain ka nafarmani ki wajah se rona."" Ibn Umar ne mujh se kaha: ""Kya tum jahannum se darte ho aur jannat mein dakhil hona chahte ho?"" Main ne kaha: ""Haan, Allah ki qasam!"" Un ne poocha: ""Kya tumhare walidain zinda hain?"" Main ne kaha: ""Meri maa mere paas hai."" Un ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam! Agar tum us se narm kalam karo aur use khana khilao, toh tum jannat mein dakhil hoge jab tak kabira gunahon se bachte raho."
"7","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Urwah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha [Allah ke farman ke bare mein]: {""Aur un dono ke liye rehmat se aajzi ka bazu jhuka do""} [Bani Israil: 24]; unhon ne kaha: ""Koi cheez na roko jo dono pasand karte hon."
"8","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Koi aulaad apne walid ka badla nahin de sakti, siwa iske ke use ghulam paye toh use khareed le aur aazad kar de."
"9","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abu Burdah se riwayat hai ke woh Ibn Umar ke paas hazir the jab ek Yamani shakhs Baitullah ka tawaf kar raha tha aur apni maa ko apni peeth ke peeche uthaye hue tha aur keh raha tha: ""Main uska mutee oont hun ... ... agar uski sawariyan dara di jayein toh main nahin darunga."" Phir us ne kaha: Ae Ibn Umar! Kya tumhara khayal hai ke main ne uska badla chuka diya? Un ne kaha: ""Nahin, uski ek aah ka bhi nahin."" Phir Ibn Umar ne tawaf kiya, phir Maqam [Ibrahim] par aaye aur do rakat namaz parhi. Phir un ne kaha: ""Ae Abu Musa ke bete! Har do rakat un gunahon ko mita deti hain jo pehle kiye gaye."
"10","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ke hath par hijrat ki baiat kar raha tha, aur us ne apne walidain ko is haal mein chhoda tha ke woh ro rahe the. Aap ne farmaya: ""Un ke paas wapas jao, aur unhein hansao jaise tum ne unhein rulaya hai."
"11","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Abu Murrah se jo Umm Hani bint Abi Talib ke aazad-karda ghulam hain unhon ne use khabar di ke woh Abu Hurairah ke hamrah sawar ho kar apni zameen ki taraf gaya jo [Aqiq] mein thi. Jab woh apni zameen mein dakhil hua toh us ne buland aawaz se pukara: ""Assalamu alaiki wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, ae meri maa!"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Wa alaikas salam wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh."" Us ne kaha: ""Allah tum par reham kare jaise tum ne mujhe bachpan mein pala."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae mere bete! Aur tumhein bhi; Allah tumhein khair ki jaza de aur tum se raazi ho, jaise tum ne budhape mein mujh se neki ki."" Musa ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ka naam Abdullah bin Amr tha."
"12","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Bakrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne teen baar farmaya: ""Kya main tumhein sab se bade kabira gunah na bataun?"" Sahaba ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kyun nahin."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah ke sath shirk aur walidain ki nafarmani"" Aap tek lagaye hue the phir sambhal kar baith gaye aur farmaya: ""Suno aur jhooti baat."" Aap use bar bar kehte rahe hatta ke main ne kaha: Kaash Aap khamosh ho jayein."
"13","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Tufail se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali se sawal kiya gaya ke kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aap ko aisi baat bhi batayi hai jo tamam logon mein se kisi ko nahin batayi? Ali ne kaha ke hamein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne koi aisi baat nahin batayi jo auron ko nahin batayi magar jo meri talwar ke niyam mein hai. Phir ek sahifa nikala toh us mein likha hua tha: Allah us par lanat kare jo ghairullah ke naam par zibah kare, Allah us par lanat kare jo zameen ki had-bandi ka nishan churaye, Allah us par lanat kare jis ne walidain par lanat ki, Allah us par lanat kare jis ne bidati ko jagah di."
"14","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Darda se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe nau baton ki wasiyat farmayi hai woh yeh hain; agar tum ko tukde tukde kar diya jaye ya jala diya jaye phir bhi Allah ke sath shirk na karna, farz namaz ko kabhi jaan boojh kar na chhodna, jis ne use jaan boojh kar chhod diya us se [Allah aur uske Rasool ka] zimma baree ho gaya, kabhi sharab na peena yeh har burayi ki kunji hai, apne walidain ki itaat karna, agarche woh tumhein hukm dein ke apni duniya se nikal jao [matlab yeh ke duniya ka sara saman un ke hawale kar do] toh un ki khatir nikal jao, hukmaranon se jhagdhe na karna, agar tumhara khayal ho ke tum uske laiq ho [yani tum hi akele haq par ho], jang se kabhi na bhagna agarche tum halak ho jao aur tumhare sathi bhag jayein aur aur apne maal se apne ehl-o-ayal par kharch karna aur apne ehl-o-ayal se apni laathi ko utha na rakhna [matlab yeh hai ke adab ka koda tarbiyat ke liye qayam rakhna] aur unhein Allah Azza wa Jalla ki zaat ke bare mein darate rehna."
"15","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein ek shakhs aaya woh jihad ka irada rakhta tha, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya tumhare walidain zinda hain?"" Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Un mein ja kar jihad karo [un ki khidmat karo, yehi jihad hai]."
"16","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Us aadmi ki naak khaak aalood ho, us aadmi ki naak khaak aalood ho, us aadmi ki naak khaak aalood ho."" Sahaba ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Kis ki?, farmaya: ""Jis ne apne walidain ko apne paas budhape mein pa liya [donon ko] ya un mein se ek ko phir woh jahannum mein dakhil ho gaya."
"17","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, Allah Azza wa Jalla ke is qoul ke bare mein: {""Agar kabhi tere paas donon mein se ek ya donon budhape ko pahunch hi jayein toh un donon ko uff mat keh""} [Bani Israil: 24] is qoul tak {""Jaise unhon ne chhota hone ki halat mein mujhe pala""} [Bani Israil: 24], use surah Baraat ki aayat ne mansookh kar diya: {""Nabi aur un logon ke liye jo iman laye, kabhi jaiz nahin ke woh mushrikon ke liye bakhshish ki dua karein, khawah woh qarabat daar hon,""} [Tauba: 113]"
"18","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Saad bin Abi Waqqas se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha ke mere bare mein Quran mein chaar aayatein nazil huin hain. Meri walida ne qasam kha li thi ke jab tak main Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka sath na chhodunga woh kuchh na khayengi na piyengi. Us waqt Allah Azza wa Jalla ne yeh aayat nazil farmayi: {""Aur agar woh donon tujh par zor dein ke tu mere sath us cheez ko shareek kare jis ka tujhe koi ilm nahin toh un ka kehna mat maan aur duniya mein achhe tareeqe se un ke sath reh.""} [Luqman: 15] Doosri aayat: Main ne ek talwar li jo mujhe achhi lagi. Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Yeh mujhe haba kar dein. Is par yeh aayat nazil hui: {""Woh aap se maal-e-ghaneemat ke bare mein poochte hain.""} [Anfal: 1] Teesri: Main beemar hua toh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas tashreef laye. Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main apna maal taqseem karna chahta hun, kya main nisf ki wasiyat karun? Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin."" Main ne kaha: Sul Sulth tha? Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin."" Main ne kaha: Kya ek tihaayi ki? Toh Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khamosh ho gaye lekin Aap ke baad ek tihaayi ki wasiyat jaiz ho gayi. Aur chauthi aayat: Main ne Ansar ke chand logon ke sath sharab pi, toh un mein se ek shakhs ne oont ka jabda le kar meri naak par maar diya. Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, toh Allah Azza wa Jalla ne sharab ki hurmat wali aayat nazil farmayi."
"19","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Sayyida Asma bint Abu Bakr se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein mere paas meri maa Islam ki taraf raghib ho kar aayin. Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kya main un ke sath sila-rehmi karun? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Haan"", Ibn Uyainah kehte hain ke Allah Azza wa Jalla ne yeh aayat nazil kar di: {""Allah Taala un logon ke sath bhalayi karne se mana nahin karta jinhon ne tum se deen ke bare mein jang nahin ki hai.""} [Mumtahana: 8]"
"20","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Umar ne ek reshmi jubba dekha jo becha ja raha tha toh kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Is ko khareed lein aur juma ke din ya jab koi wafd aaye use pehna keejiye. Farmaya: ""Is qisam ka libas woh log pehente hain jin ka [aakhirat mein] koi hissa nahin."" Toh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas un mein se kuchh hulle laye gaye, ek hulla Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umar ko bhej diya. Toh Umar ne kaha: Main is ko kaise pehnun jab ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is ke bare mein jo farmana tha farma chuke hain? Farmaya: ""Main ne is liye tumhein nahin diya ke tum khud pehen lo balke is liye diya hai ke tum farokht kar ke faida utha lo ya auraton ko pehna do."" Toh Umar ne yeh jubba Makkah mein apne bhai ki taraf bhej diya aur abhi woh musalman nahin hue the."
"21","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kabira gunahon mein se yeh bhi hai ke insan apne walidain ko bura bhala kahe."" Sahaba ne tajjub se poocha: Koi kaise bura bhala keh sakta hai? Farmaya: ""Woh doosre aadmi ko gali deta hai toh woh [jawab mein] us ke baap aur us ki maa ko gali deta hai."
"22","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas se riwayat hai, woh kehte hain: Kabira gunahon mein se yeh hai ke aadmi apne walid ke liye galiyon ka sabab bane."
"23","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Bakrah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Zulm aur qata-rehmi ke ilawa koi gunah aisa nahin hai jo is baat ke zyada laiq ho ke us ke karne wale ko jald [duniya mein] saza di jaye us ke sath jo us ke liye [aakhirat mein] zakheera ki gayi."
"24","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Teen qisam ki duayein hain jin ko qabool kar liya jata hai jin ki qabooliyat mein koi shak nahin: mazloom ki dua, musafir ki dua, aur walid ki apne bete ke khilaf dua."
"25","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate hue suna: ""Kisi bachche ne god mein baat nahin ki siwaye Isa bin Maryam (alaihis salam) aur Juraij wale bachche ke."" Logon ne arz kiya: Ya Nabiullah! Juraij wala bachcha kaun hai? Farmaya: ""Juraij ek ibadat-guzar aur rahib aadmi tha aur apne ibadat-khane mein tha. Ek gaiyon ka charwaha us ke ibadat-khane ke neeche raat ko rehta tha. Is gaon ke bashindon mein se ek aurat us charwahe ke paas aati aur jati thi. Ek din Juraij ki maa us ke paas aayi aur kaha: Ae Juraij! Aur woh namaz parh raha tha. Juraij ne dil mein socha jab ke woh namaz parh raha tha ke meri maa bula rahi hai aur main namaz parh raha hun. Us ne dil mein yehi socha ke namaz ko tarjeeh de. Phir us Phir us ne dobara chilla kar pukara. Us ne dil mein kaha: Meri maa mujhe bula rahi hai aur main namaz parh raha hun toh us ne yehi socha ke apni namaz ko tarjeeh de. Phir teesri dafa woh chillayi. Us ne phir socha meri maa mujhe bula rahi hai aur yeh ke main namaz parh raha hun. Us ne yehi socha ke apni namaz ko tarjeeh de. Jab Juraij ne maa ko jawab nahin diya toh us ne kaha: Ae Juraij! Allah tujhe maut na de jab tak tu badkar auraton ka samna na kar le. Phir woh chali gayi. Badshah ke paas us [gaon wali] aurat ko laya gaya aur us ne bachche ko janam de diya tha. Badshah ne poocha: Yeh ladka kis ka hai. Us ne keh diya ke Juraij ka. Badshah ne kaha: Wahi jo ibadat-khane mein rehta hai? Us ne kaha: Haan. Badshah ne hukm diya ke Juraij ke ibadat-khane ko ddha do aur use mere paas le aao. Logon ne kulhadiyon se us ke ibadat-khane par hamla kar diya yahan tak ke woh gir gaya. Unhon ne rassiyon ke sath us ke hathon ko gardan ke sath mila kar jakad diya. Phir us ko le jaya gaya. Toh us ko badkar auraton ke paas se guzara gaya, toh us ne un ko dekha toh muskara diya aur woh us ko logon mein dekh rahi theen. Toh badshah ne [Juraij se] kaha: [Tumhein pata hai] yeh aurat kya keh rahi hai! Us ne kaha: Kya keh rahi hai? Us ne kaha: Woh yeh keh rahi hai ke uska yeh bachcha tere se hai. Toh us ne ek aurat se kaha: Tum yeh keh rahi ho. Us ne kaha: Haan. Juraij ne kaha: Woh chhota bachcha kahan hai? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh uski god mein hai. Toh woh us taraf mutawajjuh hua aur bachche se poocha: Tera baap kaun hai? Bachcha bola: Gaiyon ka charwaha. Badshah ne kaha: Kya main aapka ibadat-khana sone ka banwa dun. Juraij ne kaha: Nahin. Kaha: Kya chandi ka banwa dun? Kaha: Nahin. Kaha: Hum us ko kis ka bana dein? Kaha: Waisa hi tameer karwa do jaisa tha. Badshah ne kaha: Kaun si cheez hai jis ki wajah se tu muskaraya tha? Juraij ne kaha: Yeh ek baat thi jise main jaanta tha. Meri maa ki bad-dua mujhe lag gayi thi. Phir us ne logon ko poora qissa sunaya."
"26","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai kehte hain: Mere mutalliq jo bhi Isayi aur Yahudi sune ga woh mujh se muhabbat kare ga. Main apni maa ko jab Islam par aamada karta toh woh inkar kar detin. Main ne un ko [ek baar phir musalman hone ka] kaha: Toh unhon ne inkar kar diya. Toh main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha: Meri maa ke haq mein Allah se dua karein. Toh Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dua ki. Is ke baad main walida ke paas aaya. Unhon ne darwaza band kar rakha tha. Kehne lageen: Ae Abu Hurairah! Main musalman ho gayi. Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bataya main ne kaha: Mere liye aur meri maa ke liye dua farmayein. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Tera banda Abu Hurairah aur uski maa dono ko logon mein mehbub bana de."
"27","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mayyat ke darjat uski maut ke baad bhi buland kar diye jate hain. Toh woh poochta hai: Ae mere Rabb! Yeh kaun sa amal hai jis ki wajah se mere darjat buland hue hain? Toh kaha jata hai: Tere bete ne tere liye bakhshish talab ki hai."
"28","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Muhammad bin Sireen se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha ke ek raat hum Abu Hurairah ke paas the, toh unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Allah! Meri aur meri walida ki, aur jo un donon ke liye duaye-maghfirat kare un sab ki maghfirat kar de."" Muhammad ne mujh se kaha: Hum un donon ke liye maghfirat talab karte rahenge yahan tak ke hum Abu Hurairah ki dua mein shamil ho jayein."
"29","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab aadmi mar jata hai toh us ke amal munqata ho jate hain, siwaye teen aamal ke: jari hone wala sadqa, ilm ka woh silsila jis se faida uthaya jaye ya naik aulaad jo us ke liye dua kare."
"30","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Meri walida ka inteqal ho gaya aur unhon ne koi wasiyat nahin ki. Kya agar main un ki taraf se sadqa karun toh un ko faida pahunche ga? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Haan."
"31","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Sab se bahtareen neki yeh hai ke aadmi apne baap ke dost ke gharane se sila kare."
"32","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Urwah se ya ghair se ke Abu Hurairah ne do aadmiyon ko dekha. Toh unhon ne un mein se ek se kaha: Yeh tumhara kya lagta hai? Us ne kaha: Mere walid. Toh un ne kaha: ""Use naam se na pukaro, uske aage na chalo, aur us se pehle na baitho."
"33","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Lekin Abu Hafs Umar ne [kuniyat se pukarne ka] faisla kiya."
"34","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: {""Aur apne qareebi rishtedaron ko darao""} [Shuara: 214], Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur pukara: ""Ae Bani Kaab bin Luay! Apni janon ko aag se bachao. Ae Bani Abd Manaf! Apni janon ko aag se bachao. Ae Bani Hashim! Apni janon ko aag se bachao. Ae Bani Abd al-Muttalib! Apni janon ko aag se bachao. Ae Fatima bint Muhammad! Apni jaan ko aag se bachao, main Allah [ke azab] mein se tumhare liye kuchh ikhtiyar nahin rakhta, siwa iske ke tumhara rishta hai jise main uski tari se jodunga [uska haq ada karunga]."
"35","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Ayyub Ansari se riwayat hai ke ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke safar mein Aap ke samne aaya aur bola: Mujhe batao kya mujhe jannat se qareeb kare aur jahannum se door kare? Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah ki ibadat karo aur uske sath kisi ko shareek na karo, namaz qayam karo, zakat do, aur rishta jodo."
"36","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla ne makhlooq paida ki; jab us se farigh hua toh rahem khada hua aur bola. Allah ne farmaya: Kya?! Rahem ne kaha: Yeh qata se teri panah mangne wale ka maqam hai. Allah ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi nahin ke main us se jodun jo tum se jode aur us se todun jo tum se tode? Rahem ne jawab diya: Kyun nahin, ae mere Rabb! Allah ne farmaya: Yeh tere liye hai."" Phir Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Agar chaho toh parho: {""Phir kya tum se tawaqqo hai ke agar tumhe hukumat mile toh zameen mein fasad karo aur apne rishte tod do?""} [Muhammad: 22]"
"37","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur bola: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mere rishtedar hain jin se main jodta hun lekin woh mujh se todte hain; main un se bhalayi karta hun lekin woh mujh se burayi karte hain; woh mujh se jahalat karte hain lekin main un par sabr karta hun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Agar waisa hi hai jaisa tum kehte ho toh goya tum unhein garam raakh khila rahe ho; aur tumhare sath Allah ki taraf se un par madadgar rahega jab tak tum is par qayam raho."
"38","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Main Rahman hun, aur Main ne rahem paida kiya; Main ne uske liye apne naam se naam nikala. Jo use jodega Main use jodunga; aur jo use todega Main use todunga."
"39","[AI-translation] Abu al-Anbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Amr ke paas Wahat mein dakhil hua yani Taif mein unki zameen mein toh unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamari taraf apni ungli modi aur farmaya: ""Rahem Rahman ki [jaanib se] shaakh hai; jo use jodega woh joda jayega; jo use todega woh toda jayega; qiyamat ke din uski zabaan fa seeh aur tez hogi."
"40","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Rahem Allah [ke naam] se [aayi] shaakh hai; jo use jodega Allah use jodega; aur jo use todega Allah use todega."
"41","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo chahe ke uska rizq kushaada kiya jaye aur uski umr daraaz ki jaye, use chahiye ke sila-rehmi kare."
"42","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jo chahe ke uska rizq kushaada kiya jaye aur uski umr daraaz ki jaye, use chahiye ke sila-rehmi kare."
"43","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jo apne Rabb se dare aur sila-rehmi kare, uski umr daraaz ki jayegi [ek lafz mein: uski ajal multawi ki jayegi], uska maal badhega, aur uske ghar wale us se muhabbat karenge."
"44","[AI-translation] Miqdam bin Madikarib se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Be-shak Allah tumhein tumhari maaon ke bare mein wasiyat karta hai, phir tumhein tumhari maaon ke bare mein wasiyat karta hai, phir tumhein tumhare baapon ke bare mein wasiyat karta hai, phir tumhein qareeb tar phir qareeb tar ke bare mein wasiyat karta hai."
"45","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Rishta todne wala jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga."
"46","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak rahem Rahman se [nikli] shaakh hai; woh kehti hai: Ae mere Rabb! Mujh par zulm hua, ae mere Rabb! Main tod di gayi. Ae mere Rabb! Main, main. Ae mere Rabb! Ae mere Rabb! Toh woh use jawab deta hai: Kya tum raazi nahin ke main us se todun jo tum se tode aur us se jodun jo tum se jode?"
"47","[AI-translation] Saeed bin Samaan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ko chhote bachchon aur bewaqoofon ki hukumat se [Allah ki] panah mangte hue suna."
"48","[AI-translation] Abu Bakrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Koi gunah is se zyada laiq nahin ke Allah uske karne wale ko duniya mein jald saza de uske sath jo uske liye aakhirat mein zakheera kiya, qata-rehmi aur zulm se."
"49","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Sila karne wala woh nahin jo badle mein sila kare; lekin sila karne wala woh hai ke jab uska rishta toda jaye toh woh jode."
"50","[AI-translation] Bara se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati aaya aur bola: Ae Nabiullah! Mujhe aisa amal sikhao jo mujhe jannat mein dakhil kare. Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum ne khutba mukhtasar kiya lekin sawal wasee kiya, gardan aazad karo, aur qaid ki gardan chhudao."" Us ne poocha: Kya donon ek nahin? Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin; gardan aazad karna yeh hai ke tum gardan aazad karo, aur qaid ki gardan chhudana yeh hai ke tum gardan [ki aazadi] par madad karo; doodh dene wali bakri ka atiya, aur rishtedar par kharch. Agar tum iski taqat na rakho, toh neki ka hukm do aur burayi se roko; agar iski bhi taqat na rakho, toh apni zabaan roko siwa khair ke."
"51","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Hakeem bin Hizam se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Aapka kya khayal hai un aamal ke bare mein jo main jahiliyat mein qurb hasil karne ke liye karta tha jaise sila, ghulam aazad karna, aur sadqa kya un mein mere liye ajr hai? Hakeem ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum guzishta khair samet Islam laye [tumhare pehle aamal ka ajr tumhare liye baqi hai]."
"52","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai: Umar ne ek reshmi [hulla siyara] dekha aur kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kaash Aap ise khareed lein, phir ise juma ke din aur wafd ke aane par pehnein."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Umar! Be-shak ise wahi pehenta hai jiska [aakhirat mein] koi hissa nahin."" Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us mein se chand hulle hadiya diye gaye, phir Aap ne Umar ko ek hulla hadiya diya. Umar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Aap ne yeh mere paas bheja, halanke Aap is ke bare mein jo kehna tha keh chuke hain!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Main ne use tumhein pehenne ke liye hadiya nahin diya; main ne use tumhein bechne ya pehnane ke liye hadiya diya hai."" Toh Umar ne use apne maa-sharik bhai ko hadiya diya jo mushrik tha."
"53","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ko mimbar par kehte hue suna: ""Apne nasab seekho, phir apne rishte jodo. Allah ki qasam! Be-shak kabhi aadmi aur uske bhai ke darmiyan kuchh hota hai; agar woh jan le jo darmiyan hai uske darmiyan rahem ka talluq, toh woh use uski khilaf-warzi se rok dega."
"54","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: ""Apne nasab ki hifazat karo, tum apne rishte jodoge. Be-shak rahem door nahin jab joda jaye agarche door ho, aur qareeb nahin jab toda jaye agarche qareeb ho; aur har rahem qiyamat ke din apne malik ke samne aayega, uske liye jodne ki gawahi dega agar us ne use joda, aur us par todne ki agar us ne use toda."
"55","[AI-translation] Rifaa bin Rafe se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: ""Mere liye apni qaum jama karo."" Un ne unhein jama kiya. Jab woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke darwaze par hazir hue toh Umar andar gaye aur kaha: ""Main ne aapke liye apni qaum jama kar di."" Ansar ne suna aur kaha: ""Quraish ke bare mein wahi nazil hui."" Toh sunne aur dekhne wale aaye [janne] unhein kya kaha jayega. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bahar tashreef laye, un ke darmiyan khade hue aur farmaya: ""Kya tum mein ghair bhi hain?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan, hum mein hamara haleef, hamari behan ka beta, aur hamare aazad-karda hain."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Hamara haleef hum mein se hai; hamari behan ka beta hum mein se hai; hamare aazad-karda hum mein se hain. Aur tum suno: be-shak tum mein se mere wali muttaqi hain; agar tum un mein se ho toh wahi [durust hai]; agar nahin, toh dekho: kahin log qiyamat ke din aamal lekar aayein aur tum bojh lekar aao, phir [Allah] tum se munh pher le."" Phir Aap ne pukara: ""Ae logon!"" aur apne donon hath uthaye aur unhein Quraish ke [sardaron ke] saron par rakha ""Ae logon! Be-shak Quraish amanat wale hain; jo un par zulm kare Zuhair ne kaha: mera khayal hai Aap ne kaha: halakat samet Allah use naak ke bal gira de."" Aap ne use teen baar kaha."
"56","[AI-translation] Uqbah bin Amir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jiski teen betiyan hon, phir woh un par sabr kare aur apne maal se unhein pehnaye, toh woh uske liye aag se hijab hongi."
"57","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Koi musalman nahin jiski do betiyan hon phir woh un se husn-e-sulook kare, magar woh dono use jannat mein dakhil karengi."
"58","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne un se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jiski teen betiyan hon, phir woh unhein panah de, unki kifayat kare, aur un par reham kare, toh uske liye jannat wajib ho gayi."" Qaum mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Aur do, Ya Rasoolullah? Aap ne farmaya: ""Aur do."
"59","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kisi ki teen betiyan ya teen behnein hon phir woh un se husn-e-sulook kare, magar woh jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"60","[AI-translation] Miqdam bin Madikarib se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jo tumne apne nafs ko khilaya woh tumhare liye sadqa hai; jo tumne apne bete ko khilaya woh tumhare liye sadqa hai; jo tumne apni biwi ko khilaya woh tumhare liye sadqa hai; aur jo tumne apne khadim ko khilaya woh tumhare liye sadqa hai."
"61","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu Taaala anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne ek din kaha: ""Allah ki qasam! Zameen par koi shakhs mujhe Umar se zyada mehbub nahin."" Jab woh bahar gaye [phir] wapas aaye toh kaha: ""Tum ne kya qasam khayi ae meri beti? Maine use unhein bataya. Unhon ne kaha: ""Woh mujhe zyada azeez hai, aur beta zyada qareeb [dil ke]."
"62","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Naam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke paas hazir tha jab ek shakhs ne un se machchhar ke khoon ke bare mein poocha. Un ne poocha: ""Tum kahan se ho?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Ahl-e-Iraq se."" Un ne kaha: ""Is shakhs ko dekho: woh mujh se machchhar ke khoon ke bare mein poochta hai, halanke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke nawase ko qatl kiya. Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Dono [Hasan aur Husain] duniya mein mere do phool hain."
"63","[AI-translation] Bara se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, jabke Hasan Allah ki rehmat ho un par Aap ke kandhe par the, aur Aap farma rahe the: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main use mehbub rakhta hun, toh Tu use mehbub rakh."
"64","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Nufair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek din hum Miqdad bin al-Aswad ke paas baithe, phir ek shakhs unke samne se guzra aur bola: ""Mubarak hon un donon aankhon ko jinhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha. Allah ki qasam! Hum chahte ke hum dekhte jo tumne dekha aur hazir hote jo tum hazir hue."" Woh ghadabnak hue. Mujhe tajjub hua: us ne khair ke siwa kuchh nahin kaha! Phir woh uski taraf mutawajjuh hue aur kaha: ""Aadmi ko kya cheez ubharti hai ke woh aisi haziri ki tamanna kare jis se Allah ne use door rakha? Woh nahin jaanta, agar woh use dekhta, toh us mein uska kya haal hota? Allah ki qasam! Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aisi qaumein hazir huin jinhein Allah ne jahannum mein naak ke bal gira diya; unhon ne use jawab nahin diya aur uski tasdeeq nahin ki! Kya tum Allah Azza wa Jalla ki hamd nahin karte ke us ne tumhein nikala is haal mein ke tum apne Rabb ke siwa kuchh nahin jaante the, phir tum ne tasdeeq ki jo tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) laye? Tumhein [doosron ke] aazmaish se kifayat ki gayi. Allah ki qasam! Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sab se sakht haal mein bheje gaye jis mein koi Nabi bheja gaya: fatrat aur jahiliyat mein; woh buton ki ibadat se afzal koi deen nahin samajhte the! Phir woh Furqan lekar aaye jis se Haq aur Batil ke darmiyan farq kiya, baap aur bete ke darmiyan farq kiya hatta ke aadmi apne baap ya bete ya bhai ko kafir dekhta, halanke Allah ne uske dil ka taala iman se khol diya tha; woh jaanta ke agar woh halak hua toh woh aag mein dakhil hoga; uski aankh thandi nahin hoti, halanke woh jaanta uska mehbub aag mein hai. Wahi hai jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: {""Aur woh jo kehte hain ae hamare Rabb, hamein hamari biwiyon aur auladon se aankhon ki thandak ata farma""} [Furqan: 74]."
"65","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek din main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hua aur wahan main, meri walida, aur meri khala Umm Haram ke siwa koi na tha jab Aap hamare paas andar tashreef laye aur farmaya: ""Kya main tumhein namaz na parhaun?"" Aur woh namaz ke waqt ke siwa tha. Qaum mein se ek shakhs ne poocha: ""Aap ne Anas ko kahan rakha?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Aap ne use apne dayein rakha."" Phir Aap ne hamein namaz parhayi, phir hamare liye hamein ahl-e-bait ke liye duniya aur aakhirat ki har khair ki dua ki. Meri walida ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Aapka chhota khadim; uske liye dua karein."" Aap ne mere liye har khair ki dua ki; Aapki dua ke aakhir mein tha ke Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Uska maal aur aulaad zyada kar, aur use barkat de."
"66","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai: Ek aurat Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas aayi, toh Ayesha ne use teen khajoorein deen. Us aurat ne apne har bachche ko ek khajoor di aur apne liye ek khajoor rakhi. Donon bachchon ne do khajoorein khayein phir apni maa ko dekha; us aurat ne apni khajoor li phir use aadha kiya, aur har bachche ko aadhi khajoor di. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aaye toh Ayesha ne Aap ko khabar di, phir Aap ne farmaya: ""Tumhein is par kya tajjub hai? Be-shak Allah ne us par reham kiya uske apne donon bachchon par reham ki wajah se."
"67","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur bola: ""Kya tum apne bachchon ko bosa dete ho?! Allah ki qasam, hum unhein bosa nahin dete!"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Main tumhare liye kya kar sakta hun agar Allah ne tumhare dil se rehmat nikal li?!"
"68","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hasan bin Ali ko bosa diya, jabke Aapke paas Aqra bin Habis Tamimi baitha tha. Aqra ne kaha: ""Mere das bachche hain, main ne un mein se kisi ko bosa nahin diya!"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne uski taraf dekha phir farmaya: ""Jo reham nahin karta, us par reham nahin kiya jata."
"69","[AI-translation] Noman bin Bashir se riwayat hai ke unke walid unhein utha kar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas le gaye aur kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Main Aap ko gawah banata hun ke main ne Noman ko yeh aur yeh diya."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tumne apne sab beton ko diya?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Nahin."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir mere siwa kisi aur ko gawah banao."" Phir Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tumhein khush nahin karta ke woh neki mein barabar hon?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Kyun nahin."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir [yeh] na karo."" Abu Abdullah Bukhari ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki gawahi rukhsat nahin."
"70","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo reham nahin karta, us par reham nahin kiya jata."
"71","[AI-translation] Jarir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah us par reham nahin karta jo logon par reham nahin karta"" [doosre tareeq mein in alfaz samet: ""Jo logon par reham nahin karta Allah us par reham nahin karta""]."
"72","[AI-translation] Abu Usman se riwayat hai ke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne ek shakhs ko kaam par lagaya, phir kaam karne wale ne kaha: ""Mere itne aur itne bachche hain, main ne un mein se kisi ko bosa nahin diya!"" Umar ne kaha ya unhon ne kaha Umar ne kaha: ""Be-shak Allah Azza wa Jalla apne bandon mein se sirf sab se zyada neki karne wale par reham karta hai."
"73","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla ne rehmat ke sau hisse banaye; apne paas nawanwe rok liye aur zameen mein ek hissa utara. Usi hisse se makhlooq ek doosre par reham karti hai, hatta ke ghodi apna khur apne bachche se uthati hai is dar se ke use lag jaye."
"74","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jibreel mujhe padosi ke bare mein wasiyat karte rahe yahan tak ke main ne samjha woh use waris banayega."
"75","[AI-translation] Abu Shuraih Khuzayi se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho, use chahiye ke apne padosi se husn-e-sulook kare; jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho, use chahiye ke apne mehmaan ki izzat kare; aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho, use chahiye ke khair kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"76","[AI-translation] Miqdad bin al-Aswad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba se zina ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haram; Allah aur uske Rasool ne use haram kiya."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Aadmi ka das auraton se zina karna us par us se halka hai ke woh apne padosi ki biwi se zina kare."" Aap ne un se chori ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haram; Allah Azza wa Jalla aur uske Rasool ne use haram kiya."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Aadmi ka das gharon se chori karna us par us se halka hai ke woh apne padosi ke ghar se chori kare."
"77","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jibreel mujhe padosi ke bare mein wasiyat karte rahe yahan tak ke main ne samjha woh use waris banayega."
"78","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai ke unke liye ek bakri zibah ki gayi, phir woh apne khadim se kehne lage: ""Kya tumne hamare Yahudi padosi ko hadiya diya? Kya tumne hamare Yahudi padosi ko hadiya diya? Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jibreel mujhe padosi ke bare mein wasiyat karte rahe yahan tak ke main ne samjha woh use waris banayega."
"79","[AI-translation] Ayesha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mere do padosi hain; main kinhein hadiya dun?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Jiska darwaza tum se zyada qareeb ho."
"80","[AI-translation] Hasan se riwayat hai ke un se padosi ke bare mein poocha gaya, phir jawab diya: ""Uske samne chalees ghar, uske peeche chalees, uske dayein chalees, aur uske bayein chalees."
"81","[AI-translation] (Hasan lighairihi) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum par ek zamana aaya ya unhon ne kaha: ek waqt ke hum mein se koi apne deenar aur dirham ka apne musalman bhai se zyada haqdar na tha; phir ab deenar aur dirham hum mein se ek ko apne musalman bhai se zyada mehbub hai. Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Qiyamat ke din kitne padosi apne padosi se lipte honge, kehta hai: Ae mere Rabb! Is ne mujh par apna darwaza band kar diya aur apna maroof rok liya!"
"82","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin al-Musawwir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko Ibn Zubair ko khabar dete hue suna; unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Momin woh nahin jo ser ho aur uska padosi bhooka ho."
"83","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Dharr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere khaleel (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe teen baton ki wasiyat ki: ""Suno aur itaat karo agarche kate hue aaza wale ghulam ki ho; jab tum shorba pakao toh uska pani zyada karo, phir apne padosi ke ghar walon ko dekho, unhein us mein se maroof samet do. Aur namaz waqt par parho agar tum imam ko pao ke us ne namaz parh li, tum ne apni namaz mehfooz kar li; warna woh nafl hai"" [doosri riwayat mein in alfaz samet: ""Ae Abu Dharr! Jab tum shorba pakao toh uske pani ko zyada karo, apne padosiyon ka khayal rakho, ya apne padosiyon mein taqseem karo""]."
"84","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ke Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah Taala ke nazdeek bahtareen sathi woh hai jo apne sathi ke liye bahtareen ho; aur Allah [Taala] ke nazdeek bahtareen padosi woh hai jo apne padosi ke liye bahtareen ho."
"85","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Nafe bin Abd al-Haris se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Musalman shakhs ki saadat mein se hain: kushaada makan, naik padosi, aur aaram-deh sawari."
"86","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki dua mein se tha: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main mustaqil rehaish mein bure padosi se teri panah mangta hun, kyunke duniya ka padosi muntaqil ho jata hai."
"87","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat qayam nahin hogi yahan tak ke aadmi apne padosi, apne bhai, aur apne baap ko qatl kare."
"88","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha gaya: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Be-shak falan aurat raat ko namaz parhti hai aur din ko roza rakhti hai, karti hai, aur sadqa karti hai, lekin apne padosiyon ko apni zabaan se takleef deti hai?"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Us mein koi khair nahin, woh dozakhiyon mein se hai."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Aur falan aurat farz namaz parhti hai, aur khushk gosht ke tukde sadqa karti hai, aur kisi ko takleef nahin deti?"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Woh jannatiyon mein se hai."
"89","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga woh jiske shar se uska padosi mehfooz na ho."
"90","[AI-translation] (Sahih bima baadahu) Amr bin Muadh Ashhali se, unki dadi se: ke unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: ""Ae iman wali auraton! Tum mein se koi aurat apni padosan ke liye [atiye] ko haqeer na samjhe, agarche [sirf] bakri ka khur ho."
"91","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ae musalman auraton! Ae musalman auraton! Koi padosan apni padosan ke liye [atiye] ko haqeer na samjhe, agarche [sirf] bakri ka khur ho."
"92","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mera ek padosi hai jo mujhe takleef deta hai."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Jao. Apna saman raaste par nikal do."" Woh gaya aur apna saman nikala. Log us par jama hue aur poocha: ""Tumhara kya mamla hai?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Mera ek padosi hai jo mujhe takleef deta hai; main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr kiya, phir Aap ne farmaya: Jao. Apna saman raaste par nikal do."" Woh dua karne lage: ""Ae Allah! Us par lanat kar; Ae Allah! Use zaleel kar."" Khabar us tak pahunchi, phir woh uske paas aaya aur bola: ""Apne ghar wapas jao; Allah ki qasam, main tumhein takleef nahin dunga."
"93","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Abu Juhaifah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se apne padosi ki shikayat ki. Aap ne farmaya: ""Apna saman uthao aur use raaste par rakho; jo us par se guzrega use lanat karega."" Har guzarne wala use lanat karne laga. Phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur bola: ""Mujhe logon se kya mila?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah ki lanat unki lanat se oopar hai."" Phir Aap ne shikayat karne wale se kaha: ""Tumhein kifayat ki gayi"" ya us jaisa."
"94","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abu Amir Himshi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sauban kehte the: ""Koi do shakhs nahin jo teen din se zyada qata karein, phir un mein se ek halak ho dono is qata par marein, magar woh dono sab halak hue; aur koi padosi nahin jo apne padosi par zulm kare aur use dabaye yahan tak ke use is par majboor kare ke woh apne ghar se nikle, magar woh halak hua."
"95","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Mujahid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Amr ke paas tha aur unka khadim bakri ki khaal utar raha tha phir unhon ne kaha: ""Ae khadim! Jab farigh ho toh hamare Yahudi padosi se shuru karo."" Qaum mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Yahudi?! Allah tumhara bhala kare?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko padosi ke bare mein wasiyat karte hue suna yahan tak ke hum dare ya hum ne samjha Aap use waris banayenge."
"96","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: ""Logon mein sab se izzat wala kaun hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah ke nazdeek sab se izzat wala sab se zyada muttaqi hai."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Hum is bare mein nahin poochte."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir logon mein sab se izzat wala [doosri riwayat mein: be-shak woh kareem, kareem ka beta, kareem ka beta hai]: Yusuf, Allah ke Nabi, Allah ke Nabi ke bete, Allah ke Khaleel ke bete."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Hum is bare mein nahin poochte."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir tum mujh se Arab ke usool ke bare mein poochte ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir jahiliyat mein tum mein se bahtareen Islam mein bahtareen hain, jab woh [deen] samjhein."
"97","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Muhammad bin Ali Ibn Hanafiya se Allah ke [farman] ke bare mein: {""Neki ka badla neki ke siwa kya hai""} [Rahman: 60]; unhon ne kaha: ""Yeh naik aur fajir ke liye aam hai."" Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Abu Ubaid ne kaha: [Musajjalah ke mani] aam."
"98","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ""Bewah aur miskeenon ka kafil Allah ke raaste mein mujahid ki tarah hai, aur uski tarah jo din mein roza rakhe aur raat mein namaz parhe."
"99","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha zawja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat mere paas aayi uske sath uski do betiyan theen; us ne mujh se manga, aur mere paas ek khajoor ke siwa kuchh na mila. Main ne use di, phir us ne use apni donon betiyon mein taqseem kiya, phir khadi hui aur bahar gayi. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) andar tashreef laye toh main ne Aap ko bataya, phir Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo in betiyon mein se kisi aazmaish mein mubtela ho, phir woh un se husn-e-sulook kare, toh woh uske liye aag se hijab hongi."
"100","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Umm Saeed bint Murrah Fihri se, unke walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Main aur yateem ka kafil jannat mein in donon ki tarah honge, ya iski tarah is se"" Sufyan ne darmiyani ya anguthe ke paas wali [shahadat] mein shak kiya."
"101","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Main aur yateem ka kafil jannat mein is tarah honge."" Aap ne apni do ungliyon se ishara kiya: shahadat aur darmiyani."
"102","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Hafs se [ke Abdullah kabhi khana nahin khate the magar unke dastarkhwan par yateem hota tha]."
"103","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abza se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Dawood ne kaha: ""Yateem ke liye raheem baap ki tarah ban; jaan le ke jaisa tu boyega waisa katega. Ghina ke baad faqr kitna bura hai; aur us se zyada ya us se bura hidayat ke baad gumrahi hai. Jab tum apne dost se wada karo toh use poora karo jo tum ne us se wada kiya; agar na karo toh tumhare aur uske darmiyan dushmani paida hogi. Allah se panah mango aise dost se ke agar tum use yaad karo woh tumhari madad na kare, aur agar tum bhool jao woh tumhein yaad na dilaye."
"104","[AI-translation] Asma bin Ubaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Sireen se kaha: ""Mere paas yateem hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Us se waisa sulook karo jaisa apne bete se karte ho; use maro jaisa apne bete ko marte ho [tarbiyat ke liye]."
"105","[AI-translation] Shumaisah Atakiya se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas yateem ke adab ka zikr hua, phir unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak main yateem ko marti hun yahan tak ke woh sukoon pa le."
"106","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kisi musalman ke teen bachche nahin marte, phir aag use chhue, magar [sirf] qasam poori karne [sarsari guzarne] tak."
"107","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chhote bachche samet aayi aur boli: ""Uske liye dua karein; main teen [bachche] dafan kar chuki hun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum ne aag se mazboot panah le li."
"108","[AI-translation] Khalid Absi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mera ek beta faut hua, mujhe us par sakht ghum hua. Main ne kaha: ""Ae Abu Hurairah! Kya tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kuchh suna jo hamare dilon ko hamari mauton par taskeen de?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Tumhare chhote bachche jannat ke [daamish idhar udhar daudne wale] hain."
"109","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jiske teen bachche faut hon phir woh un par ajr ki umeed rakhe, woh jannat mein dakhil hoga."" Hum ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Aur do?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Aur do."" Main ne Jabir se kaha: ""Allah ki qasam! Mere khayal mein, agar tum kehte ek, toh Aap farmate [ek]."" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Mera bhi khayal hai, Allah ki qasam!"
"110","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai: Ek aurat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur boli: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Hum Aapki majlis mein Aap tak nahin pahunch sakte; hamare liye ek din muqarrar karein hum Aapke paas aayein."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tumhara wada falan ke ghar par hai."" Aap unke paas us wade par tashreef laye; un baton mein se jo Aap ne unhein batayein: ""Tum mein se koi aurat nahin jis ke teen bachche faut hon phir woh un par ajr ki umeed rakhe, magar woh jannat mein dakhil hogi."" Ek aurat ne kaha: ""Ya do?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ya do."" Suhail [rawi] hadees mein bahut mohtat tha aur use yaad karta tha; koi uske paas likhne ki taqat nahin rakhta tha."
"111","[AI-translation] Umm Sulaim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek din main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas thi, phir Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Umm Sulaim! Koi do musalman nahin jin ke teen bachche faut hon, magar Allah un donon ko jannat mein dakhil karega, un donon par apne fazl-o-reham se."" Main ne kaha: ""Aur do?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Aur do."
"112","[AI-translation] Shaasaa bin Muawiya se riwayat hai ke woh Abu Dharr se mile jo chadhar lapete hue the, phir kaha: ""Tumhare bete ka kya haal hai ae Abu Dharr?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Kya main tumhein bataun?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Koi musalman nahin jis ke teen bachche faut hon jo takleef ki umr ko na pahunche hon, magar Allah use jannat mein dakhil karega, un par apne fazl-o-reham se. Aur koi shakhs nahin jo musalman aazad kare, magar Allah Azza wa Jalla uske har uzw ko uske har uzw ke liye fidya banata hai [aag se]."
"113","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jiske teen bachche faut hon jo takleef ki umr ko na pahunche hon, Allah use woh aur unhein apne fazl-o-reham se jannat mein dakhil karega."
"114","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kaun hai jise apne waris ka maal apne maal se zyada mehbub ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Hum mein se koi nahin magar uska apna maal use apne waris ke maal se zyada mehbub hai."" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jaan lo ke tum mein se koi nahin magar uske waris ka maal use apne maal se zyada mehbub hai: tumhara maal woh hai jo tum ne aage bheja [kharch kiya], aur tumhare waris ka maal woh hai jo tum ne peeche chhoda [tark kiya]."
"115","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum apne darmiyan raqoob kise samajhte ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Raqoob woh hai jiski aulaad na ho."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin; lekin raqoob woh hai jis ne apni aulaad mein se kuchh aage na bheja ho [uski koi aulaad na mari ho aur us ne sabr kiya ho]."
"116","[AI-translation] Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum apne darmiyan sura kise samajhte ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Woh hai jise mard [kushti mein] gira na sakein."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin; lekin sura woh hai jo gusse ke waqt apne nafs par qaboo rakhe."
"117","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Dawat qabool karo, tohfa mat lauto, aur musalmanon ko mat maro."
"118","[AI-translation] Ali Allah ki rehmat ho un par se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aakhri baat thi: ""Namaz, namaz! Allah se daro unke bare mein jo tumhare dayein hath malik hon [ghulam]."
"119","[AI-translation] Abu Darda se riwayat hai ke woh logon se kehte the: ""Hum tumhein un se zyada jaante hain jitna janwaron ke doctor janwaron ko jaante hain; hum ne tum mein se bahtareen aur badtareen ko jaan liya. Tum mein se bahtareen: woh jiski khair ki umeed ho aur uske shar se aman ho. Tum mein se badtareen: woh jiski khair ki umeed na ho, uske shar se aman na ho, aur apne aazad-karda ghulam ko aazad na kare."
"120","[AI-translation] Amrah se riwayat hai ke Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) ne apni ek baandi ko tadbeer par aazad kiya. Ayesha beemar huin, phir unke bhai ke beton ne Zuthth se ek tabeeb se poocha. Tabeeb ne kaha: ""Be-shak tum mujhe ek aisi aurat ke bare mein bata rahe ho jis par jadu hua hai; uski baandi ne us par jadu kiya hai."" Ayesha ko khabar di gayi. Unhon ne kaha: ""Tum ne mujh par jadu kiya?"" Baandi ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Ayesha ne poocha: ""Kyun? Tum kabhi najat nahin paogi."" Phir unhon ne kaha: ""Use Arab ke sab se bure shakhs ko milkiyat wali baandi bana kar becho."
"121","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do chhote khadimon samet tashreef laye, phir Aap ne un mein se ek Ali ko diya Allah ki rehmat ho un par aur farmaya: ""Use mat maro; be-shak mujhe namaz parhne wale ko marne se mana kiya gaya hai, aur main ne use namaz parhte dekha jab se hum aaye."" Aap ne Abu Dharr ko ek khadim diya aur farmaya: ""Uske sath husn-e-sulook ki wasiyat rakho."" Abu Dharr ne use aazad kar diya. Aap ne poocha: ""Us ne kya kiya?"" Abu Dharr ne jawab diya: ""Aap ne mujhe uske sath bhalayi ka hukm diya tha, toh main ne use aazad kar diya."
"122","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madina tashreef laye baghair khadim; Abu Talha ne mera hath pakda, mujhe le gaye yahan tak ke mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil kiya, phir kaha: ""Ae Nabiullah! Be-shak Anas zaheen aur samajhdar ladka hai; use Aapki khidmat karne dein."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne safar aur qiyam mein Aapki khidmat ki, Madina aane se, yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafat pa gaye; Aap ne mujh se mere kiye par kabhi nahin kaha: Aisa kyun kiya? Aur mujh se mere na kiye par kabhi nahin kaha: Aisa kyun na kiya?"
"123","[AI-translation] Laqit bin Sabirah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahuncha, jabke charwaha bakri ke bachche ko baade mein hank chuka tha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mat samjho aur Aap ne nahin kaha: tum mat samjho ke hamari sau bakriyan hain jinhein hum badhana nahin chahte; jab charwaha bakri ke bachche samet aaye hum uski jagah bakri zibah karte hain."" Aapki baton mein se tha: ""Apni biwi ko mat maro jaise tum apni baandi ko marte ho; aur jab tum istinshaq karo, mubalagha karo; siwa iske ke tum rozedar ho."
"124","[AI-translation] Abu al-Aliya se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Hamein hukm diya jata tha ke khadim par mohar lagayein, naapein, aur ginein; is dar se ke woh bure akhlaq ke aadi hon, ya hum mein se koi bure gumaan kare."
"125","[AI-translation] Salman se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak main apne khadim ke liye haddi [khane ka hissa] ginta hun, gumaan ke dar se [doosri riwayat mein: bure gumaan ke khauf se]."
"126","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Abdullah bin Qusait se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar ne apne ghulam ko sone ya chandi de kar bheja, phir us ne use tabdeel kiya aur tabdeele ki hawale mein takheer ki. Ghulam unke paas wapas aaya, phir unhon ne use dard-naak kode lagaye aur kaha: ""Jao. Mera haq lo aur use tabdeel na karo."
"127","[AI-translation] Abu Masud se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main apne khadim ko maar raha tha, phir main ne apne peeche se aawaz suni: ""Jaan lo, ae Abu Masud! Allah tum par tum se zyada qadir hai jitne tum us par ho."" Main ne mud kar dekha, toh woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) the. Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Woh Allah ke liye aazad hai."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Agar tum ne aisa na kiya hota, toh aag tumhein chhuti"" ya: ""aag tumhein jalati."
"128","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Na kaho: Allah uska chehra bigade."
"129","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Hargiz na kaho: Allah tumhara chehra aur uska chehra bigade jo tumhare chehre jaisa ho; be-shak Allah Azza wa Jalla ne Aadam (alaihis salam) ko apni soorat par paida kiya [jo uske layaq hai]."
"130","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi apne khadim ko mare, toh use chahiye ke chehre se bache."
"131","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek janwar jiski naak daaghne se dhuan nikal raha tha Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne se guzra! Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah lanat kare us par jis ne yeh kiya; koi chehre ko na chhue aur use na mare."
"132","[AI-translation] Hilal bin Yasaf se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Suwaid bin Muqarrin ke ghar mein kapda bechte the, phir ek baandi bahar aayi aur ek shakhs se kuchh kaha, phir us shakhs ne use thappad mara. Suwaid bin Muqarrin ne us se kaha: ""Tum ne uska chehra thappad mara?! Be-shak main saat mein se saatwan tha humare paas ek khadim ke siwa kuchh na tha phir hum mein se ek ne use thappad mara; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use hukm diya ke use aazad kare."
"133","[AI-translation] Zadzan Abu Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Ibn Umar ke paas the, phir unhon ne apne ghulam ko bulaya jise unhon ne mara tha aur uski peeth kholi. Unhon ne poocha: ""Kya tumhein dard hota hai?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Nahin."" Ibn Umar ne use aazad kar diya, phir zameen se ek lakdi uthayi aur kaha: ""Mujhe us mein is lakdi ke wazan barabar ajr nahin milta."" Main ne kaha: ""Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Tum aisa kyun kehte ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna ya unhon ne kaha: ""Jo apne ghulam ko aisi saza se mare jo us ne nahin ki, ya uska chehra thappad mare [doosre lafz mein: Jo apne ghulam ko thappad mare ya use aisi saza se mare jo us ne nahin ki], toh uska kaffara use aazad karna hai."
"134","[AI-translation] Ammar bin Yasir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Koi shakhs apne ghulam ko nahin marta jabke woh us par zulm karta ho magar qiyamat ke din us se qisas liya jayega."
"135","[AI-translation] Abu Laila se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Salman bahar nikle, toh uske janwar ka chara khurli se gir raha tha, phir us ne apne khadim se kaha: ""Agar mujhe qisas ka khauf na hota, toh main tumhein takleef deta."
"136","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Haqq walon ko zaroor ada kiye jayenge, yahan tak ke baghair seeng wali bakri ka seeng wali bakri se qisas liya jayega."
"137","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jis ne maar se mara [zulm se], qiyamat ke din us se qisas liya jayega."
"138","[AI-translation] Ubadah bin al-Walid bin Ubadah bin as-Samit se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main apne walid ke sath is Ansar ki basti mein ilm talash karne nikla, unke faut hone se pehle. Pehle shakhs jin se hum mile Abu al-Yusr, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi the, unke sath unka ek khadim tha; Abu al-Yusr burdah aur muafiri kapda pehne the, aur unka khadim burdah aur muafiri kapda pehne tha. Main ne un se kaha: ""Ae mere chacha! Kaash tum apne khadim ki burdah le lo aur use apna muafiri de do ya uska muafiri lo aur use apni burdah de do tum mukammal libas mein ya woh mukammal libas mein ho!"" Unhon ne mera sir sehlaya aur kaha: ""Ae Allah, us mein barkat de. Ae mere bhatije! Meri yeh donon aankhein dekhti hain, mere yeh donon kaan sunte hain, aur mera dil yaad rakhta hai"" aur unhon ne apne dil ki taraf ishara kiya ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate hain: Unhein khilao jo tum khate ho, aur unhein pehnao jo tum pehente ho."" Aur use duniya ke saman mein se dena mujhe us se halka hai ke woh qiyamat ke din meri nekiyan le."
"139","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghulamon ke bare mein khair ki wasiyat karte the, aur farmate the: ""Unhein khilao jo tum khate ho, unhein pehnao jo tum pehente ho, aur Allah Azza wa Jalla ki makhlooq ko azab na do."
"140","[AI-translation] Marur bin Suwaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Dharr ko jubba pehne dekha aur unke khadim ko jubba pehne [doosri riwayat mein: woh kapda pehne the aur unka khadim jubba pehne tha; hum ne kaha: agar tum yeh le lo aur use doosra de do toh mukammal libas ho jaye] hum ne un se uske bare mein poocha? Unhon ne jawab diya: Main ne ek shakhs ko bura kaha, phir us ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se meri shikayat ki. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: ""Kya tum ne use uski maa se aar dilayi?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Phir Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak tumhare bhai tumhare khadim hain; Allah ne unhein tumhare hathon ke neeche kiya hai. Jiska bhai uske hath ke neeche ho, use chahiye ke use khilaye jo woh khata hai, use pehnaye jo woh pehenta hai, unhein woh bojh na do jo un par ghalib aaye; agar tum unhein woh bojh do jo un par ghalib aaye, unki madad karo."
"141","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: ""Kaam karne wale ki uske kaam mein madad karo; be-shak Allah ka kaam karne wala nakam nahin hoga"" yani: khadim."
"142","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ghulam ke liye [haq hai] uska khana aur uska kapda, aur use aise kaam ka bojh na diya jaye jo woh na seh sake."
"143","[AI-translation] Miqdam se riwayat hai: unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jo tumne apne nafs ko khilaya woh sadqa hai; jo tumne apne bete, apni biwi, aur apne khadim ko khilaya woh sadqa hai."
"144","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bahtareen sadqa woh hai jo kifayat chhode; oopar wala hath neeche wale hath se bahtar hai; aur us se shuru karo jiska [kharch] tum zimme lete ho..."
"145","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sadqe ka hukm diya. Ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Mere paas ek deenar hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne nafs par kharch karo."" Us ne kaha: ""Mere paas doosra hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Apni biwi par kharch karo."" Us ne kaha: ""Mere paas doosra hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne khadim par kharch karo, phir tum zyada jaante ho [baqi ka]."
"146","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zubair ne mujhe khabar di: ke unhon ne [ek shakhs ko] suna Jabir se aadmi ke khadim ke bare mein poochte hue jab woh use mushaqqat aur garmi se kifayat kare; kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke use [khane par] bulaye? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan. Agar tum mein se koi uske sath khane se inkar kare, toh use apne hath se ek luqma khilaye."
"147","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se kisi ka khadim uska khana lekar aaye, toh use bithaye; agar na mane, toh use us mein se kuchh khilaye."
"148","[AI-translation] Abu Mihzarah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas baitha tha jab Safwan bin Umayyah ek bada thaal lekar aaye jise chand log abaa kapde mein uthaye hue the; unhon ne use Umar ke samne rakha. Umar ne miskeenon aur ghulamon mein se jo logon ke ghulam unke ird-gird the bulaya; unhon ne uske sath khaya. Phir unhon ne us waqt kaha: ""Allah ek qaum ko halak kare"" ya unhon ne kaha: ""Allah ek qaum par lanat kare"" ""jo apne ghulamon se katrate hain ke woh unke sath khayein."" Safwan ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam! Hum un se nahin katrate, lekin hum [khud ko] un par tarjeeh dete hain; hamein Allah ki qasam! Achha khana nahin milta jo hum khayein aur unhein khilayein."
"149","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak jab ghulam apne aaqa se mukhlis ho aur apne Rabb ki ibadat khub ada kare, uske liye dohra ajr hai."
"150","[AI-translation] Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: ""Teen shakhs jinhein dohra ajr milta hai: Ahl-e-Kitab mein se ek shakhs jo apne Nabi par iman laya aur Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par iman laya, toh uske liye dohra ajr hai; ghulam jab Allah ka haq aur apne aaqaon ka haq ada kare [doosri riwayat mein: apne malik ka haq jo uska malik hai]; aur ek shakhs jiski ek baandi ho jis se woh sohbat karta ho, phir woh use adab sikhaye aur uska adab khub sikhaye, use taleem de aur uski taleem khub de, phir use aazad kare phir us se nikah kare, toh uske liye dohra ajr hai."" Amir ne kaha: [Ae mere shagird!] Hum ne use tumhein baghair iwaz diya, halanke pehle is se kamtar ke liye Madina tak sawari ki jati thi."
"151","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Khabardar, tum mein se har ek nigraan hai aur tum mein se har ek se uski riaya ke bare mein poocha jayega: logon par ameer nigraan hai aur us se uski riaya ke bare mein poocha jayega; mard apne ghar walon par nigraan hai aur us se unke bare mein poocha jayega; aadmi ka ghulam [doosre tareeq mein: khadim] apne aaqa ke maal par nigraan hai aur us se uske bare mein poocha jayega; [aurat apne shohar ke ghar mein nigraan hai] aur [us se poocha jayega]; [main ne yeh sab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sune, aur mera khayal hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur mard [nigraan hai] apne baap ke maal par]; khabardar tum mein se har ek nigraan hai aur tum mein se har ek se uski riaya ke bare mein poocha jayega."
"152","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Musalman ghulam jab Allah ka haq aur apne aaqa ka haq ada kare, uske liye dohra ajr hai."" Us zaat ki qasam jiske hath mein Abu Hurairah ki jaan hai! Agar Allah ke raaste mein jihad, hajj, aur apni maa se neki na hoti, toh main chahta ke ghulam hote hue marun."
"153","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi na kahe: Mera ghulam, meri baandi; tum sab Allah ke bande ho, aur tumhari sab auratein Allah ki bandiyan hain; use kehna chahiye: Mera ladka khadim, meri ladki khadima, mera jawan, meri jawan."
"154","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi na kahe: Mera ghulam aur meri baandi; ghulam na kahe: Mere aaqa mard aur meri aaqa aurat; use kehna chahiye: Mera jawan aur meri jawan, mere aaqa mard aur meri aaqa aurat; tum sab mamluk ho, aur Rabb: Allah Azza wa Jalla hai."
"155","[AI-translation] Mutarrif se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne kaha: Main Bani Amir ke wafd mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gaya. Unhon ne kaha: ""Aap hamare sayyid hain."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Sayyid Allah hai."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Sab se afzal fazl wale aur sab se bada ata karne wale."" Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: ""Apni baat kaho, shaitan tumhein na ghaseete."
"156","[AI-translation] Abu Sulaiman Malik bin al-Huwairis se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye jab hum hum-umr jawan the; hum bees raatein thehre. Aap ne samjha hum apne ghar walon ke mushtaq hain, phir hum se poocha unke bare mein jinhein hum apne ghar walon mein chhod aaye? Hum ne Aap ko bataya aur Aap narm aur raheem the phir farmaya: ""Apne ghar walon ke paas wapas jao, unhein sikhao aur unhein hukm do; namaz parho jaise tum ne mujhe namaz parhte dekha. Jab namaz ka waqt aaye, toh tum mein se ek azaan kahe, aur tumhara bada tumhari imamat kare."
"157","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah Ansari se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jise neki di jaye use chahiye ke uska badla de; agar badla na de sake, toh uski tareef kare. Agar us ne uski tareef ki, us ne shukr ada kiya; agar us ne use chhupaya, us ne [nemat ka] kufr kiya. Jo us se aarasta ho jo use nahin diya gaya, goya us ne jhoot ke do kapde pehne."
"158","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo Allah ke waseele se panah mange, use panah do; jo Allah ke waseele se mange, use do; jo tum se neki kare, uska badla do; agar tum na pao, toh uske liye dua karo yahan tak ke maloom ho ke tum ne uska badla de diya."
"159","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai ke Muhajireen ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya Ansar sara ajr le gaye?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin. Jab tak tum Allah se unke liye dua karte ho, aur un par uski wajah se tareef karte ho."
"160","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah ka shukr ada nahin karta woh jo logon ka shukr ada nahin karta."
"161","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah Taala nafs se farmata hai: Nikal. Nafs kehta hai: Main majboori ke siwa nahin nikluga."
"162","[AI-translation] Abu Dharr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: poocha gaya [doosri riwayat mein un se ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha]: kaun sa amal bahtareen hai? [doosri riwayat mein: kaun sa amal afzal hai]? Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah par iman aur uske raaste mein jihad."" Poocha gaya [doosri riwayat mein: unhon ne kaha]: kaun si gardan afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: ""Sab se mehengi qeemat wali, aur apne walon ke nazdeek sab se nafees."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Batao agar main baaz amal ki taqat na rakhun?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum zaya hone wale ki madad karo, ya na-samajh ke liye karo."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Batao agar main kamzor hun?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum logon ko apne shar se roko; be-shak woh sadqa hai jo tum apne nafs par karte ho."
"163","[AI-translation] Qabeesah bin Burmah Asadi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas tha, main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: ""Duniya mein maroof wale, aakhirat mein maroof wale hain; aur duniya mein munkar wale aakhirat mein munkar wale hain."
"164","[AI-translation] Motamir ne bayan kiya: Main ne apne walid se Abu Usman ki hadees ka zikr kiya Salman se: ke unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak duniya mein maroof wale, aakhirat mein maroof wale hain."" Mere walid ne kaha: ""Main ne use Abu Usman se suna jo use Salman se bayan karte the; main ne jana woh waisa hi hai, lekin main ne use kisi se kabhi bayan nahin kiya."" [Abu Usman se doosri riwayat mein, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us jaisa farmaya]."
"165","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Har maroof sadqa hai."
"166","[AI-translation] Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Har musalman [par] sadqa hai."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Agar na paye?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh apne hathon se kamaye, apne nafs ko nafa de, aur sadqa kare."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Agar taqat na rakhe, ya na kare?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh hajat-mand mazloom ki madad kare."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Agar na kare?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh khair ka hukm de, ya maroof ka hukm de."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Agar na kare?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh shar se ruke; be-shak woh uske liye sadqa hai."
"167","[AI-translation] Abu Dharr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Poocha gaya: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Maal wale ajr le gaye: woh namaz parhte hain jaise hum namaz parhte hain, roza rakhte hain jaise hum roza rakhte hain, aur apne fazil amwal se sadqa karte hain?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya Allah ne tumhare liye woh nahin banaya jo tum sadqa karo? Be-shak har tasbeeh aur tahmeed sadqa hai; aur tum mein se ek ka [jismani] talluq sadqa hai."" Poocha gaya: ""Uski shahwat mein sadqa hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Agar woh use haram mein rakhta, kya us par gunah na hota? Isi tarah agar woh use halal mein rakhe toh uske liye ajr hai."
"168","[AI-translation] Abu Barzah Aslami se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mujhe aisa amal batao jo mujhe jannat mein dakhil kare."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Logon ke raaste se takleef door karo."
"169","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah [raziyallahu anhu] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ek musalman raaste mein kaante ke paas se guzra, phir bola: Main is kaante ko zaroor hataunga taake kisi musalman ko nuqsan na de phir use bakhsh diya gaya."
"170","[AI-translation] Abu Dharr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Mujhe meri ummat ke aamal dikhaye gaye achhe aur bure main ne uski achhi aamal mein paya: raaste se takleef hatayi jati hai; aur main ne uski bure aamal mein paya: masjid mein balgham jo dafan [saaf] na kiya jaye."
"171","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Yazid Khatmi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Har maroof sadqa hai."
"172","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kuchh diya jata, Aap farmate: ""Use falan ke paas le jao; be-shak woh Khadija ki saheli thi. Use falan ke ghar le jao; be-shak woh Khadija se muhabbat karti thi."
"173","[AI-translation] Huzaifah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Har maroof sadqa hai."
"174","[AI-translation] Amr bin Abu Qurrah Kindi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne apni behan Salman ko pesh ki, lekin Salman ne inkar kiya aur apni aazad-karda baandi se nikah kiya jiska naam Baqirah tha. Abu Qurrah tak khabar pahunchi ke Huzaifah aur Salman ke darmiyan kuchh hua tha. Woh un se milne aaye; khabar di gayi ke woh apne sabzi ke bagh mein hain. Woh wahan gaye aur unhein sabziyon ki tokri samet paya unhon ne apni laathi tokri ke surakh mein dali hui thi apne kandhe par. Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Abu Abdullah! Tumhare aur Huzaifah ke darmiyan kya hua?"" Salman ne kaha: {""Aur insan bada jald-baaz hai""} [Bani Israil: 11]. Donon chale yahan tak ke Salman ke ghar aaye. Salman ghar mein dakhil hue aur kaha: ""Assalamu alaikum."" Phir unhon ne Abu Qurrah ko ijazat di; woh dakhil hue, toh ek mota kapda darwaze par bichha tha aur uske sirhane eentein theen, aur ek qarathath kapda tha. Salman ne kaha: ""Apni malika ke bistar par baitho jo us ne apne liye bichhaya."" Phir woh bayan karne lage: Huzaifah aisi baatein bayan karte the jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne gusse mein chand qaumon ke bare mein kahi theen, phir mere paas aaya gaya aur unke bare mein poocha gaya? Main ne jawab diya: ""Huzaifah jo kehta hai use zyada jaanta hai; mujhe qaumon ke darmiyan keena pasand nahin."" Phir Huzaifah ke paas aaya gaya aur un se kaha gaya: ""Be-shak Salman tumhari tasdeeq nahin karta aur tumhein jhutlata nahin jo tum kehte ho!"" Huzaifah mere paas aaye aur kaha: ""Ae Salman bin Umm Salman!"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Ae Huzaifah bin Umm Huzaifah! Tumhein rukna hoga, ya main Umar ko tumhare bare mein likhunga."" Jab main ne unhein Umar se daraya, unhon ne mujhe chhod diya. Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya tha: ""Main Aadam ki aulaad mein se hun; meri ummat mein se jis bande par main lanat karun ya use bura kahun uske muqaam ke baghair toh use us par salat [rehmat] bana de."
"175","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Saeed Khudri ke paas aaya woh mere dost the phir kaha: ""Kya tum hamare sath khajoor ke bagh ki taraf na chaloge?"" Woh nikle aur un par unki khameesa thi."
"176","[AI-translation] Ali Allah ki rehmat ho un par se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abdullah bin Masud ko hukm diya ped par chadhe aur us mein se Aapke liye kuchh laye. Unke sahaba ne Abdullah ki pindli dekhi phir unki pindliyon ke patle hone par hanse! Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum kis par hanste ho? Abdullah ki pindli meezan mein [pahaad] Uhud se zyada bhaari hai."
"177","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Momin apne bhai ka aayina hai; jab woh us mein aib dekhe, use durust kare."
"178","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Momin apne bhai ka aayina hai; momin [doosre] momin ka bhai hai: woh use zaya se bachata hai aur uske peeche se uski hifazat karta hai."
"179","[AI-translation] Mustaurid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo [muslim ki izzat gira kar] musalman ke zariye khaye, Allah use jahannum mein se us jaisa khilayega; jise [kisi] musalman [ko gira kar] pehnaya gaya, Allah Azza wa Jalla use jahannum mein se pehnayega; aur jo kisi shakhs ke sath riya aur suma ke liye khada ho, Allah use qiyamat ke din riya aur suma ke maqam par khada karega."
"180","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin as-Sayib se, unke walid se, unke dada [Yazid bin Saeed] se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yani farmate hue suna: ""Tum mein se koi apne sathi ka saman na le, mazaq mein ya sanjeedgi mein; jab tum mein se koi apne sathi ki laathi le, toh use use wapas kare."
"181","[AI-translation] Abu Masud Ansari se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur bola: ""Meri sawari kat gayi [mar gayi/kamzor hui]; mujhe sawari do."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Mere paas nahin hai; lekin falan ke paas jao, shayad woh tumhein sawari de."" Woh uske paas gaya, us shakhs ne use sawari di. Woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di. Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo khair ki rahnumayi kare, uske liye karne wale jaisa ajr hai."
"182","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai ke ek Yahudi aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas zehr-aloor bakri lekar aayi, phir Aap ne us mein se kuchh khaya; aurat layi gayi, phir poocha gaya: ""Kya hum use qatl na karein?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: Main hamesha use [zehr ke asar ko] Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke taaloo mein pehchanta tha."
"183","[AI-translation] Wahb bin Kaisan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Zubair ko mimbar par kehte hue suna: {""Muaf karne wale ban, maroof ka hukm de, aur jahilon se munh pher""} [Aaraf: 199]; unhon ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam! Use lene ka hukm nahin diya gaya magar logon ke akhlaq se; Allah ki qasam, main use un se lunga jab tak main unke sath rahun."
"184","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Sikhao, aasan karo [sikhao aur aasan karo teen baar], mushkil na karo; jab tum mein se koi gusse mein ho, toh use khamosh rehna chahiye [do baar]."
"185","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas se mila, phir kaha: ""Mujhe Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki Taurat mein sifat ke bare mein khabar do."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Haan, Allah ki qasam! Be-shak Aap ki sifat Taurat mein Quran mein Aapki baaz sifat se bayan hui hai: {""Ae Nabi, be-shak Hum ne tumhein gawah [shaahid], khushkhabri dene wala, aur darane wala bana kar bheja""} [Ahzab: 45]; aur ummiyon ke liye hifazat: tum mere bande aur mere Rasool ho; Main ne tumhara naam rakha: al-Mutawakkil; woh sakht aur kara nahin hai, bazaron mein cheekhne wala nahin; burayi ka badla burayi se nahin deta, lekin muaf karta hai aur bakhshta hai; Allah Taala use wafat nahin dega yahan tak ke woh us se tedhi millat ko seedha kare: woh kahein: La ilaha illallah; us se andhi aankhein kholi jayein, behre kaan khole jayein, aur band dil khole jayein."
"186","[AI-translation] Muawiya se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek baat suni jis se Allah ne mujhe nafa diya; main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna ya unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Agar tum logon par bad-gumani karo, tum unhein bigad doge."" Toh main un par bad-gumani nahin karta taake unhein na bigadun."
"187","[AI-translation] Jarir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab se main Islam laya Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe jab bhi dekha mere chehre par muskuraye."
"188","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Is darwaze se Yaman ke bahtareen shakhs mein se ek shakhs dakhil hoga; uske chehre par farishte ka hath [phera gaya] hai."" Phir Jarir dakhil hue."
"189","[AI-translation] Ayesha zawja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kabhi qahqaha laga kar hanste hue nahin dekha yahan tak ke unka taaloo dikhe; Aap sirf muskurate the (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)."" Unhon ne kaha: Jab Aap badal ya hawa dekhte, uska asar chehre par dikhta [doosre tareeq mein: jab ghane badal dekhte, Aap andar jate aur bahar aate, aage badhte aur peeche hatte, aur chehra badal jata; jab barish hoti, woh door ho jata]. Ayesha ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Log jab badal dekhte hain khush hote hain, umeed ke us mein barish hogi; lekin main Aapko dekhti hun jab Aap use dekhte hain, Aapke chehre par na-pasandeedgi dikhti hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Ayesha! Mujhe kya zamanat hai ke us mein azab nahin hai? Ek qaum ko hawa se azab diya gaya; ek qaum ne azab dekha, phir kaha: {""Yeh badal hum par barish barsayega""} [Ahqaf: 24] [doosre tareeq mein: main nahin jaanta, shayad jaise Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: {""Phir jab unhon ne use apni wadiyon ki taraf aate badal ke roop mein dekha""} aayat]."
"190","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Hansi kam karo [doosri riwayat mein: zyada na hanso]; be-shak zyada hansi dil ko maar deti hai."
"191","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne sahaba ke ek giroh ke paas nikle jo hans rahe the aur baatein kar rahe the. Aap ne farmaya: ""Us zaat ki qasam jiske hath mein meri jaan hai! Agar tum jaante jo main jaanta hun, toh tum kam hanste aur zyada rote."" Phir Aap chale gaye aur qaum ko rulaya. Allah Azza wa Jalla ne Aap ki taraf wahi ki: ""Ae Muhammad! Tum mere bandon ko mayus kyun karte ho?"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wapas tashreef laye aur farmaya: ""Khush raho, seedhe raho, aur [haq se] qareeb raho."
"192","[AI-translation] Musa bin Muslim, Qariz ki beti ke aazad-karda ghulam se, Abu Hurairah se: ke woh kabhi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hue kehte: ""Mujhe khoobsurat palkon wale, safaid pehlu wale ne bayan kiya; jab woh mutawajjuh hote, mukammal mutawajjuh hote; jab woh peeth pherte, mukammal peeth pherte; kisi aankh ne un jaisa nahin dekha, aur na dekhegi."
"193","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu al-Haisam se farmaya: ""Kya tumhare paas khadim hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Nahin."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab hamare paas qaidi aayein, hamare paas aao."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas do qaidi laye gaye teesre ke baghair; Abu al-Haisam Aapke paas aaye. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Un donon mein se chun lo."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mere liye chun dein."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak jis se mashwara liya jaye woh moatabar hai; yeh lo, kyunke main ne use namaz parhte dekha; aur uske sath khair ki wasiyat rakho."" Unki biwi ne kaha: ""Tum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki uske bare mein kahi ko nahin pahunchoge magar use aazad karke."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Woh aazad hai."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah ne koi Nabi aur na khalifa bheja, magar uske do qareebi sathi hote hain: ek sathi jo use khair ka hukm deta hai aur munkar se rokta hai, aur ek sathi jo use fasad se nahin chhodta; jo bure sathi se bachaya gaya, woh bachaya gaya."
"194","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne parha: {""Aur un se [baaz] muamle mein mashwara karo""} [Aal Imran: 159]."
"195","[AI-translation] Hasan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam! Koi qaum mashwara nahin karti magar unhein apne samne bahtareen ki hidayat di jati hai."" Phir unhon ne parha: {""Aur unka muamla [unke darmiyan] mashware se [tay hota] hai""} [Shura: 38]."
"196","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo mere oopar woh kahe jo main ne nahin kaha, use chahiye ke aag mein apni jagah bana le."
"197","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Us zaat ki qasam jiske hath mein meri jaan hai! Tum jannat mein dakhil nahin hoge yahan tak ke tum Islam lao, aur Islam nahin laoge yahan tak ke tum ek doosre se muhabbat karo; salam phailao tum ek doosre se muhabbat karoge. Aur bughz se bacho; be-shak woh mundne wali hai main tum se nahin kehta: baal mundti hai, lekin deen mundti hai."
"198","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nematein kufr ki jati hain, rishte tode jate hain, aur hum ne dilon ke qareeb hone jaisa nahin dekha."
"199","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni baaz biwiyon ke paas se guzre unke sath Umm Sulaim theen [un se doosre tareeq mein: ke Bara bin Malik mardon ko hanka karte the, aur Anjasha auraton ko hankate the, aur woh khush-aawaz the]. Nabi [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ne farmaya: ""Ae Anjasha! Aahista sheeshe [auraton] ko hankao."" Abu Qilabah ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek kalima kaha agar tum mein se koi use kahe, toh tum use us par aib lagate. Unka qoul: ""sheeshe hankana."
"200","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya Aap hum se mazaq karte hain?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak main haq ke siwa kuchh nahin kehta."
"201","[AI-translation] Bakr bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba tarbooz [pheink kar] mazaq karte the; lekin jab haqeeqi muamla hota toh wahi [asal] mard the."
"202","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas sawari mangne aaya. Aap ne farmaya: ""Main tumhein oontni ke bachche par sawari dunga!"" Us ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Main oontni ke bachche ka kya karunga?!"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya oontniyan oontni ke bachche ke siwa janti hain [sab oont oontni ke bachche hain]."
"203","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hum se ghul-mil jate the, yahan tak ke mere chhote bhai se kehte: ""Ae Abu Umair! Nughair [tumhari chhoti chidiya] ne kya kiya?!"
"204","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Darda se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Meezan mein husn-e-akhlaq se zyada bhaari koi cheez nahin."
"205","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fahhsh aur mutafahhish na the; Aap farmate the: ""Tum mein se bahtareen woh hain jo akhlaq mein sab se achhe hon."
"206","[AI-translation] Amr bin Shuayb se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se: ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Kya main tumhein na bataun tum mein se mujhe sab se zyada mehbub aur qiyamat ke din mujh se majlis mein sab se qareeb kaun hoga?"" Qaum khamosh rahi; Aap ne use do ya teen baar dohraya. Qaum ne kaha: ""Haan Ya Rasoolullah!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo akhlaq mein sab se achhe hon."
"207","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak mujhe makarim-e-akhlaq ko mukammal karne ke liye bheja gaya hai."
"208","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko do muamlon mein ikhtiyar na diya gaya magar Aap ne asaan ko chuna jab tak gunah na ho; jab gunah hota toh Aap sab logon se zyada us se door hote. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne nafs ke liye kabhi badla nahin liya, siwa iske ke Allah Taala ki hurmat todi jaye, toh Aap Allah Azza wa Jalla ke liye badla lete."
"209","[AI-translation] Abdullah [bin Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak Allah Taala ne tumhare darmiyan akhlaq taqseem kiye jaise Us ne tumhare darmiyan rizq taqseem kiya. Be-shak Allah Taala maal use deta hai jise woh mehbub rakhta hai aur jise mehbub nahin rakhta, lekin iman sirf use deta hai jise mehbub rakhta hai. Jo maal kharch karne mein bakheel ho, dushman se jihad karne se dare, aur raat guzarne [ibadat mein] se dare, toh use kasrat se kehna chahiye: La ilaha illallah, Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, Allahu Akbar."
"210","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ghina maal ki kasrat se nahin hai, lekin ghina nafs ka ghina hai."
"211","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki das saal khidmat ki; Aap ne mujhe kabhi uff tak nahin kaha; mujh se mere na kiye par kabhi nahin kaha: Tum ne aisa kyun na kiya? Aur mujh se mere kiye par kabhi nahin kaha: Tum ne aisa kyun kiya?"
"212","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raheem the; Aapke paas koi na aata magar Aap use wada karte aur use poora karte agar Aapke paas hota. Namaz qayam hui, phir ek dehati aaya aur Aapka kapda pakda: Meri hajat thodi reh gayi hai; mujhe dar hai main bhool jaunga, toh Aap uske sath khade rahe yahan tak ke woh apni hajat se farigh hua, phir wapas aaye aur namaz parhi."
"213","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kuchh manga na gaya phir Aap ne kaha: Nahin."
"214","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zubair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ayesha aur Asma se zyada sakhi do aurtain nahin dekheen; donon ki sakhawat mukhtalif hai: Ayesha cheez par cheez jama kartin, jab unke paas jama ho jati toh taqseem kartin; jabke Asma kal ke liye kuchh nahin rokteen."
"215","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah ke raaste ka ghubar aur jahannum ka dhuan bande ke pait mein kabhi jama nahin honge; aur bakheel-pan aur iman bande ke dil mein kabhi jama nahin honge."
"216","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Rabiah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Abdullah ke paas baithe the unhon ne ek shakhs ka zikr kiya aur uske akhlaq ka zikr kiya phir Abdullah ne kaha: ""Batao agar tum uska sir kaat do kya tum use wapas la sakoge?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Uska hath?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Uska paon?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak tum uska jism badalne ki taqat nahin rakhte; yahan tak ke tum uska akhlaq badlo! Be-shak nutfa reham mein chalees raatein theherta hai, phir khoon banta hai, phir loothda banta hai, phir boti banta hai; phir Allah farishta bhejta hai, phir likha jata hai: uska rizq, uska akhlaq, bad-bakht ya khush-bakht."
"217","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak aadmi apne husn-e-akhlaq se raat ko [namaz mein] khade hone wale ke darje tak pahunchta hai."
"218","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aba al-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Islam mein tum mein se bahtareen woh hain jo akhlaq mein sab se achhe hon, jab woh [deen] samjhein."
"219","[AI-translation] Sabit bin Ubaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne Zaid bin Sabit se zyada muazziz kisi ko na dekha jab woh qaum ke sath baithe, aur apne ghar mein hans-mukh."
"220","[AI-translation] (Hasan lighairihi) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla ko kaun sa deen sab se zyada mehbub hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kushaada [rawadar] Hanifiyat."
"221","[AI-translation] (Sahih mauqoofan, aur sahih bhi marfooan) Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Chaar khaslatein agar tumhein di jayein toh tumhein nuqsan nahin degi jo duniya tum se chhoot jaye: husn-e-akhlaq, khane ki hifazat [haram se], sachchi baat, aur amanat ki hifazat."
"222","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya tum jaante ho sab se zyada kya aag mein dakhil karta hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Allah aur uske Rasool zyada jaante hain."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Do khokhli cheezein: sharmgah aur munh. Aur sab se zyada kya jannat mein dakhil karta hai? Allah ka taqwa aur husn-e-akhlaq."
"223","[AI-translation] Usamah bin Sharik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas tha, phir dehati aaye bahut se log idhar aur udhar se; log khamosh hue, unke siwa koi baat nahin karta tha. Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya hum par is aur is mein gunah hai?"" logon ke muamlon ki cheezon ke bare mein, jin mein koi harj nahin. Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah ke bandon! Allah ne gunah utha diya; siwa us shakhs ke jo [haq] le zulm se wahi gunahgar aur halak hua."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya hum ilaj karayein?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Haan, ae Allah ke bandon, ilaj karao; be-shak Allah Azza wa Jalla ne koi beemari nahin rakhi magar uski shifa rakhi; ek beemari ke siwa."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Woh kya hai, Ya Rasoolullah?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Budhapa."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Insan ko di gayi bahtareen cheez kya hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Husn-e-akhlaq."
"224","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khair mein sab logon se zyada sakhi the; Aap Ramadan mein sab se zyada sakhi hote, jab Jibreel (alaihis salam) Aap se milte. Jibreel Ramadan ki har raat Aap se milte; Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhein Quran sunate. Jab Jibreel Aap se milte, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khair mein chalne wali hawa se zyada sakhi hote."
"225","[AI-translation] Abu Masud Ansari se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum se pehle ummaton mein se ek shakhs ka hisab hua; us mein khair nahin payi gayi, siwa iske ke woh logon se milta-julta tha aur maal-dar tha, phir woh apne khadimon ko hukm karta tha ke tang-dast se darguzar karein. Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Hum iske us se zyada haqdar hain; toh Us ne use muaf kar diya."
"226","[AI-translation] Nawwas bin Samaan Ansari se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se neki aur gunah ke bare mein poocha? Aap ne farmaya: ""Neki: husn-e-akhlaq hai. Gunah: jo tumhare dil mein khatke, aur tum na-pasand karo ke log us par muttala hon."
"227","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tumhare sardar kaun hain, ae Bani Salamah?"" Hum ne jawab diya: ""Jadd bin Qais, siwa iske ke hum use bakheel samajhte hain."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Bukhl se badh kar kaun si beemari hai? Balke tumhare sardar Amr bin al-Jamuh hain."" Amr jahiliyat mein unke buton ke muntazim the, aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye waleema karte the jab Aap nikah karte."
"228","[AI-translation] Warrad Mughirah ke katib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya ne Mughirah bin Shubah ko likha: ""Mujhe woh likho jo tum ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna."" Mughirah ne unhein likha [doosri riwayat mein: unhon ne kaha aur izafa kiya: unhon ne mujhe imla karaya, main ne apne hath se likha]: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mana karte the afwahon, maal zaya karne, zyada sawal karne, [rokne] haq rokne aur mangne, maaon ki nafarmani, aur betiyon ko zinda dafan karne se."
"229","[AI-translation] Amr bin al-Aas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere paas bheja, mujhe hukm diya ke apne kapde aur hathiyar lun, phir Aapke paas aaun. Main ne aisa kiya aur Aapke paas aaya jab Aap wuzu kar rahe the; Aap ne mujhe oopar phir neeche dekha, phir farmaya: ""Ae Amr! Main chahta hun tumhein lashkar par bhejun; Allah tumhein maal-e-ghaneemat de, aur main tumhare liye maal ki achhi khwahish rakhta hun."" Main ne kaha: ""Main maal ki khwahish mein Islam nahin laya; main Islam ki khwahish mein Islam laya taake main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath rahun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Amr! Bahtareen halal maal naik shakhs ke liye hai."
"230","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Mihsan Ansari se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo subah apni rehaish mein aman samet kare, apne jism mein aafiyat samet, uske paas us din ka khana ho, goya uske liye duniya jama kar di gayi."
"231","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Khubaib Juhani se, unke chacha se: ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unke paas ghusl ke baad nikle, khush-tabiat; hum ne samjha Aap apni biwi ke paas gaye the. Hum ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Hum Aapko khush-tabiat dekhte hain?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Haan, Alhamdulillah."" Phir Aap ne ghina ka zikr kiya. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Muttaqi ke liye ghina mein koi harj nahin; muttaqi ke liye sehat ghina se bahtar hai; aur dil ka sukoon nematon mein se hai."
"232","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sab logon mein bahtareen, sab se zyada sakhi, aur sab se zyada bahadur the. Ek raat Madina wale ghabra gaye; log aawaz ki taraf gaye, phir unhein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mile jo un se pehle aawaz ki taraf ja chuke the aur farma rahe the: Darna mat. Darna mat Aap Abu Talha ke ghode par the jo nanga baghair zeen ke tha, talwar gardan mein thi. Aap ne farmaya: Main ne use samandar ki tarah paya ya be-shak woh samandar hai [tez]."
"233","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Har maroof sadqa hai; maroof mein se hai ke tum apne bhai ko khile chehre se milo, aur apne dol se apne bhai ke bartan mein dalo."" Main ne kaha: Pehla jumla guzar chuka [165/224]."
"234","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Yazid bin Babnus se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Ayesha ke paas dakhil hue, phir kaha: ""Ae Ummul Momineen! Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka akhlaq kya tha?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Aapka akhlaq Quran tha..."
"235","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah ko kisi par kabhi lanat karte hue nahin suna koi insan [ho]. Salim ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Momin ke liye munasib nahin ke woh lanat karne wala ho."
"236","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Yahudi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: ""As-sam alaikum [tum par maut]."" Ayesha ne kaha: ""Wa alaikum; Allah tum par lanat kare aur tum par ghadabnak ho."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tehro, ae Ayesha! Tum par narmi lazim hai; sakhti aur fahash se bacho."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya Aap ne nahin suna unhon ne kya kaha?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tum ne nahin suna main ne kya kaha? Main ne unhein jawab diya; mere haq mein unke bare mein qabool kiya gaya, aur unke haq mein mere bare mein qabool nahin kiya gaya."
"237","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Momin taan karne wala, lanat karne wala, fahhsh, aur gandi [zabaan wala] nahin hai."
"238","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Do chehron wale ke liye munasib nahin ke woh moatabar ho."
"239","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Momin ka badtareen akhlaq fahash hai."
"240","[AI-translation] Abu Darda se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak lanat karne wale qiyamat ke din gawah aur sifarshi nahin honge."
"241","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Siddiq ke liye munasib nahin ke woh lanat karne wala ho."
"242","[AI-translation] Huzaifah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Koi qaum ek doosre par lanat nahin karti magar un par lanat wajib ho jati hai."
"243","[AI-translation] Ayesha se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr ne apne baaz ghulamon par lanat ki, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ae Abu Bakr! Lanat karne wale aur siddiq?! Hargiz nahin, Kaaba ke Rabb ki qasam"" [do ya teen baar]. Abu Bakr ne us din apne baaz ghulam aazad kiye, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: ""Main dobara nahin karunga."
"244","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Poocha gaya: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mushrikeen par Allah se bad-dua karein."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak mujhe lanat karne wala bana kar nahin bheja gaya, lekin mujhe rehmat bana kar bheja gaya hai."
"245","[AI-translation] Hammam se riwayat hai: Hum Huzaifah ke sath the. Un se kaha gaya: ""Be-shak ek shakhs baat Usman tak pahunchata hai!"" Huzaifah ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Chughal-khor jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga."
"246","[AI-translation] Asma bint Yazid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya main tumhein tum mein se bahtareen ke bare mein na bataun?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Kyun nahin."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh ke jab dekhe jayein, Allah yaad aaye. Kya main tumhein tum mein se badtareen ke bare mein na bataun?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Kyun nahin."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh jo chughli samet chalte hain, doston ke darmiyan fasad karte hain, be-gunahon par aib talash karte hain."
"247","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Fahash kehne wala aur use phailane wala, gunah mein barabar hain."
"248","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Shubail bin Auf se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kaha jata tha: ""Jo fahash sune phir use phailaye, woh us mein us jaisa hai jis ne use ghadha."
"249","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Ata se riwayat hai: ""Ke woh zina phailane wale par saza ke qayal the; unhon ne kaha: us ne fahash phailaya."
